### Download Historical Data

Link: <https://www.freqtrade.io/en/stable/data-download/#usage>
Command: freqtrade download-data -c user_data/config_binance_spot.json --timerange 20240101- -t 1m 5m 15m 30m 1h 2h 4h 1d

### List Available Data

Link: <https://www.freqtrade.io/en/stable/data-download/#sub-command-list-data>
Command: freqtrade list-data -c user_data/config_binance_spot.json --show-timerange

### Recursive analysis

Link: <https://www.freqtrade.io/en/stable/recursive-analysis/>
Command: freqtrade recursive-analysis -i 5m -s AwesomeStrategy -c user_data/config_binance_spot.json --startup-candle 50 100 150 250 300 --timerange 20240201-20240301 -p BTC/USDT

### Backtesting

Link: <https://www.freqtrade.io/en/stable/backtesting/#backtesting-command-reference>
Command: freqtrade backtesting --strategy AwesomeStrategy --timeframe 1h --timerange 20240201-20240801 --breakdown month -c user_data/config_binance_spot.json --timeframe-detail 5m
